WEBVTT

00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:02.520
Practices

00:00:03.220 --> 00:00:05.390
Is Tuesday’s practice planned?

00:00:06.390 --> 00:00:08.400
Put a practice on the schedule.

00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:13.370
Choose the length and the number of coaches: the blocks fill in on their own.

00:00:14.370 --> 00:00:17.380
Pick your drills from a bank of illustrated drills.

00:00:18.380 --> 00:00:22.230
And to find the best night, check the possible time slots once.

00:00:23.230 --> 00:00:25.960
Every week, your coaches get an email…

00:00:26.960 --> 00:00:32.930
… and rank their top three nights. Game nights are blocked, and everyone sees the others’ choices.

00:00:33.930 --> 00:00:38.140
On Friday, you get the summary: the best night, and who voted for what.

00:00:39.140 --> 00:00:43.400
The message for the field coordinator is already written: copy, send.

00:00:44.400 --> 00:00:49.330
Forgot? On Saturday, a reminder: did you contact Sylvie?

00:00:50.530 --> 00:00:54.740
BaseballLineup. Less paperwork, more baseball.
